###
### START ignore everything
###
# ignore everything by default
*
# do not ignore directories (still ignores their content)
!*/
# still ignore directories with a leading dot
.*/
# do not ignore .gitignore files
!.gitignore
###
### END ignore everything
###

!/*.py
!/*.sh
!/*.md
!/*.c
# The media bench is a directory of a Makefile, helpers and a README: the top-level allow-list
# above does not reach into it, so name it.
!/media/Makefile
!/media/*.py
!/media/*.md
